# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist-ssr
*.local

# NOTE: `dist` is deliberately NOT ignored.
# The production server (Pterodactyl) deploys with `git pull` and serves
# frontend/dist directly. This file used to ignore `dist`, while some old
# bundles were already committed — so every rebuild was invisible to git and
# production kept serving a stale bundle whose asset hashes no longer matched
# index.html. That is a white screen, and it is silent.

